GRAPH <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Architecture> {
  <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Architecture> a narr:Digest ;
    narr:digestOf <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Architecture> ;
    narr:childCount "7"^^xsd:integer ;
    narr:generatedFrom "8a96432e833c3e2e7b68680554739a844377a751" ;
    narr:narration """This hub gathers the architecture of Quinton Fairweather's Meridian deployment gate, established 20260717. [Quinton's gate declaration](narr:Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_1) announces the core mandate in formal, authority-ranking register. [The motivating incident](narr:Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_2) grounds it in a concrete past failure: two unsigned artifacts reached staging last quarter, and that breach is named as the whole reason the gate exists. [The gate restated in structured form](narr:Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_3) and [its scope](narr:Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_4) together specify that the signed-manifest requirement applies to both staging and production. [Ownership self-assignment](narr:Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_5) functions as a commitment, with Quinton as sole named accountable party. Two broader nodes synthesize these: [scope-and-ownership](narr:MeridianGateScopeAndOwnership) frames the dual-environment span under CTO accountability, while [the gate's rationale](narr:SignedReleaseManifestGate) ties the mandate to the staging incident. The cluster is single-voice, single-date, and policy-declarative throughout; no dissent or counter-proposal appears in the children.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_5> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#MeridianGateScopeAndOwnership> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#SignedReleaseManifestGate> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Every Meridian deployment now requires a signed release\nmanifest before it ships." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We saw two unsigned artifacts reach staging\nlast quarter and that is the whole reason for the gate." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Gate**: signed release manifest required for Meridian deploys" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_3> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Scope**: applies to staging and production" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_4> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Owner**: Quinton Fairweather" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_5> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "All five expression-children are single-actor (Quinton only) and single-date — no other voice ratifies, contests, or qualifies the gate, leaving open whether broader team acknowledgment or dissent exists elsewhere." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_1> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_5> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The motivating incident is framed in market-pricing / rational-persuasion register rather than authority alone, suggesting the gate's legitimacy rests partly on the incident's persuasive force — a framing that could be contested if the incident's severity is disputed." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "Scope is stated as staging and production, but development and pre-staging environments are not addressed — an absence that may matter for queries about full pipeline coverage." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_4> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#MeridianGateScopeAndOwnership> ] ;
    narr:writer "anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.6" .
}